        },
        {
          "name": "Grouping",
          "type": "string&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "_LIBCPP_HIDE_FROM_ABI string",
      "docs": "Determines the required grouping based on the size of the input.\nThe grouping's last element will be repeated. For simplicity this repeating\nis unwrapped based on the length of the input. (When the input is short some\ngroups are not processed.)\n@returns The size of the groups to write. This means the number of\nseparator characters written is size() - 1.\n@note Since zero-sized groups cause issues they are silently ignored.\n@note The grouping field of the locale is always a @c std::string,\nregardless whether the @c std::numpunct's type is @c char or @c wchar_t."
    },
